  "answer": "This has been requested before, and it isn't available yet. The main tracking issue is PowerToys#24283, \"Allow customization of the quick access icons\". Other reports (#43000, #41213, #34030, #35977, #45277) were closed as duplicates of it. They ask for the same things you do: choosing which tools appear, pinning them, and reordering them. There is no workaround, because the Quick Access list can't be customized. Disabling a module is the only way to remove an item, and you can't add tools that aren't shown. Add your +1 and your Good/Better/Great proposal to #24283. Your search-box idea is partly covered already. A search box was added to PowerToys in version 0.94 (see #39619), though that ticket doesn't say whether it covers the Quick Access flyout itself."
 },
